    <briefdescription>
<para>A SystemC module for dumping the hierarchy of objects in a specified format. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classscc_1_1hierarchy__dumper" kindref="compound">hierarchy_dumper</ref> class provides a method for dumping the hierarchy of SystemC objects to a file in various formats. It can be used to visualize the structure of a SystemC design or to analyze the interactions between different components.</para>
